# Play uploads authenticate with a service account JSON key that the workflow
# writes from the tenant's GitHub environment (PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON), and
# with the upload keystore written from PLAY_KEYSTORE_BASE64. Nothing here is
# read from the repo, so this file only documents the expectation.

# The package name comes from the generated app/tenant.properties (baked into
# the AAB) and is passed in as PLAY_PACKAGE_NAME by the workflow.
